<view class="page"><view class="head-row"><view><view class="eyebrow">记录一口真实体验</view><view class="title">分享这一口</view><view class="sub">不用写得很专业，告诉同好值不值得吃</view></view><view class="step">1 / 2</view></view><view class="photo" bindtap="chooseImage"><image wx:if="{{image}}" src="{{image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><block wx:else><text class="photo-icon">📷</text><text>拍照 / 选择照片</text><text class="photo-tip">有照片更容易被同好发现</text></block></view><input placeholder="菜品名称，例如：招牌牛肉面" value="{{dishName}}" bindinput="onName"/><input placeholder="店铺名称（选填）" value="{{store}}" bindinput="onStore"/><textarea class="note" maxlength="160" placeholder="一句话说说为什么值得吃（选填）" value="{{note}}" bindinput="onNote"/><view class="label">口味标签 <text class="hint">选 1～4 个</text></view><view class="tags"><text wx:for="{{tagOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="tag {{tags.indexOf(item)>=0?'on':''}}" data-tag="{{item}}" bindtap="toggleTag">{{item}}</text></view><view class="label">你的态度</view><view class="status"><button data-status="yes" bindtap="setStatus">❤️ 许吃</button><button data-status="conditional" bindtap="setStatus">🤔 有条件</button><button data-status="no" bindtap="setStatus">👎 不许吃</button></view><view class="current">告诉同好你的真实态度 · 会影响以后推荐</view><view class="submit-wrap"><button class="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting?"正在记录…":"记住这一口"}}</button><text>发布后会出现在「发现」，也会帮助许吃以后推荐得更准</text></view></view>